        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif tracking-tight text-stone-900 leading-[1.1]">
          The Invisible Ingredient: How Fragrance Can Change the Way We Taste Wine
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          Why personal fragrance, laundry detergent—and even the garden around a winery—can influence the wine in your glass.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-stone-500">
          Independent guide from <a href="/about" class="underline hover:text-stone-800">Bellie Acres Wine</a>. 21+ for alcohol tastings.
